  "details": "Apple device and iOS version:\n\nIPhone 14 on Version 17.5.1\n\nInstalled VRC Testflight Version and VRC Build Number\n\n2024.2.3 (333) and VRC Build 1472\n\nDescription of the Issue:\n\nThe space taken up by the removed \"Switch Account\" button is still there.\n\nSteps I took:\n\nOpened the main menu and went to Settings and looked in the top left where it would be\n\nWhat do you expect to happen?\n\nThe space that the \"Switch Account\" button is in to be halved to match the amount of space the remaining \"Exit VRChat\" button takes up\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nThe space the \"Switch Account\" button takes up is still there\n\nNote: I'm reporting the space still being there and not the \"Switch Account\" button being missing, because I believe that it was an intentional removal since you have to switch accounts while in the Launcher",
